cs="#m-202d736a-3bac-4d3c-9c6a-1964e73e4942" label="lyrics-like">tuénda Ecclésiae libertáte, virtutel râre. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5ea0c1d9-1522-4595-904b-5204fef91009" facs="#m-559b7cc5-67fc-4dc7-918a-16fe8550cc96" label="text-like">Commemoration of S. Urbain I. Pope and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-5383ca9d-0ac5-4291-b36b-3cdf08dcf383" facs="#m-ebeead58-1fb5-44ad-9b44-ac9d8df7fcdc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-959852af-fcef-44c3-a483-56a08cd77d94" facs="#m-5e0cb689-60e2-490f-8713-3382d3fb7697" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum. Pastor aetérne, tua protectióne custódi; *quem</l><l xml:id="m-172d1ee9-636f-4ac8-9596-b441d951b861" facs="#m-aaef0b60-4a4d-4db1-938d-83a1f95c9bf4" label="lyrics-like">(Y placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-6a1e38f0-f93c-4d97-9f79-f921037f2cee" facs="#m-dc57eddf-fe4e-4e96-a070-e4ddfe3e8684" label="lyrics-like">totius Ecclésiae praestitisti esse pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c189ede-bda7-42c2-90dc-e2e75c9569b3" facs="#m-3de2338b-1858-48a8-bee7-b0c9748340c0" label="lyrics-like">beátum Urbánum Mártyrem tuuml stórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d13f0ef3-20e1-4838-8a80-fe52d5da69c7" facs="#m-d837c8a8-aa17-46cd-b88a-8c53bb784432" label="lyrics-like">atque Summum Pontificem, perpé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6e5da4e-4435-416d-a3d0-e4b69099ab94" facs="#m-6431d222-ef4e-4f5b-99ec-5b7b1eec7336" label="text-like">Secret. Munera. p. 1122e. and Postcommunion. Multiplica. p. 1123.</l><l xml:id="m-1a89a214-dca7-457f-92e8-4d98a02fac2b" facs="#m-3b775c79-2119-45db-b82e-b4d489200d39" label="ambiguous">St. Philip Neri, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-65813b98-d0b8-47bb-aa26-f6e7cd8ae205" facs="#m-0b45adc5-8006-43d2-a03b-a546a6ba99f8" label="ambiguous">26.</l><l xml:id="m-d43b7c43-ca1f-4eae-9971-bc649cc84fd3" facs="#m-4b50ffbc-6f63-43d0-8879-0d21a3e934ec" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-aed88edb-5e25-4f1d-bc67-8bee35c12a0f" facs="#m-820901a5-c5de-4d0d-b030-3668c796aa78" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-84625ab4-e20a-40db-9e66-a3f019d6afc0" facs="#m-fd826e72-8078-47a7-a06a-218d34706ea7" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-149a9cd0-9814-46ff-8268-703dc0b9c22e" facs="#m-13fb414b-0dbe-4116-a1cf-c0d88ac657da" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-954f4d0c-cee6-461b-9992-999af4062389" facs="#m-c87a8aa0-9dc9-4a30-8cbf-bc93eafbf2f0" label="lyrics-like">Ari-tas Dé-i“diffú- sa est in córdibus</l><l xml:id="m-e8628889-c778-4e03-a28c-66988f0e08e1" facs="#m-4081fab0-c3d0-41a3-bfd1-add3fff84554" label="lyrics-like">nó-stris per inhabi-tán¬ tem Spí¬ ri-tum é-jus in</l><l xml:id="m-50897c04-ff80-4a2a-b3a5-5641fa6a7343" facs="#m-b81b508d-4d20-42dc-b589-068c23f41bf2" label="lyrics-like">nó- bis. T. P. Alle- lú- ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-f995d8c5-105b-4b8a-857a-405910e5a66d" facs="#m-c65a4617-602d-4a96-8f02-07ffbc09ab95" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Bé¬</l><l xml:id="m-9da3ee94-26eb-4264-a9ab-4a1b95e296bb" facs="#m-9b3074ee-d59b-4785-ac54-5e56d9329214" label="lyrics-like">nedic ánima mé-a Dómi-no: “et ómni-a quae intra</l><l xml:id="m-cf0e7bc8-15de-41c7-8f0c-85396e6fb868" facs="#m-b2f08b52-d7f4-4994-8a13-08c5fa3ae443" label="lyrics-like">me sunt, nómi-ni sáncto éjus. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-eb795944-5443-40a0-a4e3-b54a439ae786" facs="#m-d5fa9ded-2850-40b1-8d19-b185520537de" label="ambiguous">Eu o"a e</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
